recommend keep-going the fenced-block asymmetry in prose Truth is the next round -- Reach skips fenced code and backtick spans where Truth does not, and the measurement already taken says it reaches 20+ living documents, so take the blast radius file by file before changing the reading, decide whether a link inside a fence is an illustration in prose as it is in a program, and plant it from both sides; beside it, .rish and .sh comments sit outside the ASCII guard that reads *.rye alone
